{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax Parkour</strong> is a single-player parkour adventure set high above the clouds. Test your agility and timing across <strong>16 handcrafted levels</strong> filled with <strong>floating platforms</strong>, <strong>tricky obstacles</strong>, and satisfying jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be <strong>challenging yet calming</strong>, Relax Parkour offers a minimal, peaceful environment where you can focus purely on movement and flow. Whether you're hopping between platforms, avoiding swinging traps, or figuring out the best route forward, every level provides a fresh parkour challenge to overcome at your own pace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721240?t=1748060416","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721240?t=1748060416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721240/c77b0c8d1beff111ba042f430ea5f53d9321d985/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748060416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721240/c77b0c8d1beff111ba042f430ea5f53d9321d985/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748060416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax Parkour</strong> is a single-player parkour adventure set high above the clouds. Test your agility and timing across <strong>16 handcrafted levels</strong> filled with <strong>floating platforms</strong>, <strong>tricky obstacles</strong>, and satisfying jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be <strong>challenging yet calming</strong>, Relax Parkour offers a minimal, peaceful environment where you can focus purely on movement and flow. Whether you're hopping between platforms, avoiding swingin